Third-party notices for mithra_flutter_sdk
==========================================

This file carries attribution that used to sit at the bottom of LICENSE. It was
moved here because pub.dev detects a package's license by matching the whole of
LICENSE against the SPDX templates: a second, differently-attributed license
block appended to the file defeats that match, and the package was published as
`license:unknown`. LICENSE now contains the MIT text and nothing else.

Moving the text changes nothing about the obligations below; it only lets the
license of this package be identified.

